  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 1,
      "bbox": [
        90,
        77,
        131,
        899
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "BDEL.",
      "text": "But suffering what are you groaning, mule? Is it because today we are going to sell you? But don't groan any longer, mule. What is this affair? Why are you groaning, if you are not carrying an Odysseus?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 2,
      "bbox": [
        136,
        88,
        150,
        827
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOSIAS",
      "text": "But by Zeus it is carrying this certain someone underneath, at any rate.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 3,
      "bbox": [
        155,
        89,
        169,
        581
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "BDEL.",
      "text": "Who is the mule carrying? Who are you, fellow?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 4,
      "bbox": [
        174,
        88,
        187,
        345
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "PHIL.",
      "text": "Nobody by Zeus.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 5,
      "bbox": [
        193,
        88,
        207,
        595
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "BDEL.",
      "text": "You, Nobody? From which country are you?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 6,
      "bbox": [
        212,
        88,
        226,
        532
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "PHIL.",
      "text": "An Ithakan, the son of runaway horse.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 7,
      "bbox": [
        232,
        88,
        303,
        905
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "BDEL.",
      "text": "Drag him from beneath. O most foul man. I know you are the most wicked of all men. For my father is most like Odysseus, as it seems to me at any rate. But, Father, push the mule and yourself into the house with, all urgency. You then, Sosias, push many of the stones towards the door with your hands.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 8,
      "bbox": [
        309,
        88,
        342,
        836
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOS.",
      "text": "Alas poor me! What is this? From wherever did the clod of earth fall on me?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 9,
      "bbox": [
        347,
        88,
        361,
        613
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "XAN.",
      "text": "Look, master. The man is becoming a sparrow.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 10,
      "bbox": [
        367,
        88,
        420,
        903
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "BDEL.",
      "text": "Alas wretched me! For it does not escape my notice that my father is becoming a sparrow. But he will anticipate us by escaping. Where, where is my net? Shoo, shoo, shoo back!",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stage_direction",
      "order": 11,
      "bbox": [
        425,
        189,
        439,
        521
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(He pursues the father with the net.)",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 12,
      "bbox": [
        445,
        88,
        498,
        908
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "SOS.",
      "text": "Come now. Since we have shut him in, and the old man will not again give trouble to us who have shut him in and are guarding him, nor will he escape our notice by running away, why don't we sleep for a little while?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
